  "notes": "Pre K campers must be 4 by September 1, 2027 and fully toilet trained. Groups: Mini Camp pre K to K, Day Camp grades 1 to 4, Senior Camp grades 5 to 6 (adds a weekly Skills Lab and an off campus trip). Camp day 9 am to 3 pm with early bird drop off from 7:30 am and after care to 6 pm (pre registration required; 2027 care rates not posted). Snack provided, campers pack lunch. Weeks 2 and 5 are four day weeks with prorated tuition. Summerside also runs about 40 specialty camps (STEM, arts, sports) on the same campus; the 2027 list is not posted yet. Shuttlebee busing from Center City and Northwest Philadelphia started in 2026.",
